<!-- Example of Digital NOTAM for a apron usage limitation change ("additionally allowed for"):
     Apron A usage is extended to unscheduled military aircraft with wingspan up to 42 m, private piston aircraft and gliders:
  
     Airport/Heliport: EADA DONLON/INTL.
                Apron: EADA DONLON/INTL. | APRON A
           Start Time: 2028-03-07 08:00
             End Time: 2028-03-07 18:00
             Schedule: -
      Limitation Type: Additionally allowed for
           Limitation: Prior Permission: -
                       Prior Permission Details: -
                       Sublimitation 1: Aircraft - wingspan: 60 M
                                                 - wingspan interpretation: AT_OR_BELOW
                                        Flight   - military: MIL
                                                 - purpose: NON_SCHEDULED
                       Sublimitation 2: Aircraft - engine: PISTON
                                        Flight   - purpose: PRIVATE
                       Sublimitation 3: Aircraft - type: UAV
               Reason: static display of aircraft
                 Note: -
-->

